        "retry-rule": {
          "text": "Retried statuses are 429, 502, 503 and 504. A 408 is retried except on the /models/instances/query endpoint. A 409 is retried only when the cdf-is-auto-retryable header is true. Up to 10 retries (MaxRetries) are made for these codes, and up to 2 (MaxRetries408) for 408. The delay is random jitter between 0 and base x 2^retry, with base 1000 ms for most codes and 2000 ms for 408, capped at 60000 ms. GraphQL responses that return HTTP 200 with both errors and data are retried with the 408 budget and delay.",
